"<h3>The Story</h3>\n<p>I GOT IT. over I DID NOT GET IT.: this volleyball hoodie is for the player who calls every ball loud and clear and then watches it hit the floor, worn at practice, in the bleachers and on the long drive home from tournament weekend.</p>\n<p>A cartoon volleyball in a terry headband and high-top sneakers stands ready with its mouth wide open mid-shout, speed lines all around, under I GOT IT. in giant red capitals and I DID NOT GET IT. in mustard capitals, both outlined in navy. Original art, made for Graphic Tees Co. and printed the day you order it.</p>\n<h3>Details &amp; Fit</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic fit pullover hoodie with a front pouch pocket</li>\n<li>50% pre-shrunk cotton, 50% polyester</li>\n<li>Fabric weight: 8 oz/yd\u00b2</li>\n<li>Double-lined hood with matching drawcord</li>\n<li>Quarter-turned body to avoid a crease down the middle</li>\n<li>Rib-knit cuffs and waistband with spandex</li>\n<li>Sizes S\u20133XL</li>\n<li>2 colors: Sand and Navy</li>\n<li>Blank product sourced from Bangladesh, Nicaragua, Honduras or El Salvador</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Questions</h3>\n<p><strong>How does the volleyball hoodie fit?</strong><br>The I Got It. I Did Not Get It. volleyball hoodie from Graphic Tees Co. is a classic unisex pullover in sizes S through 3XL. Order your usual size, or go up one for a roomier fit over a team tee. Compare the size chart with a hoodie you already own.</p>\n<p><strong>What colors does this volleyball hoodie come in?</strong><br>This Graphic Tees Co. volleyball hoodie comes in Sand and Navy, both in sizes S through 3XL. The red and mustard capitals and the red, cream and navy ball read on both, with a navy outline around every letter, so pick the shade that matches your team bag.</p>\n<p><strong>Is it warm enough for a cold gym?</strong><br>Yes. It is a 50% cotton, 50% polyester fleece pullover at 8 oz per square yard, with a double-lined hood, matching drawcord and a front pouch pocket. That is plenty for a chilly gym, an outdoor tournament or the bleachers, and it layers easily over a team tee.</p>\n<p><strong>How do I wash it so the print lasts?</strong><br>Turn the hoodie inside out, wash it in cold water with similar colors and tumble dry on low. Skip bleach and fabric softener, and never iron over the print. Printed to order by Graphic Tees Co., it holds its color wash after wash. Misprints are reprinted or refunded within 30 days.</p>\n<p><strong>When should I order it as a Christmas gift?</strong><br>Order by about December 8 to have it before Christmas. Every Graphic Tees Co. hoodie is printed to order and ships free in the US on orders of $45 or more. The free size exchange within 30 days covers a guessed size, so it works for the player, the coach or the volleyball mom.</p>"